    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12396333/comment/12598018",
          "id": "12598018",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rpuch",
            "name": "rpuch",
            "key": "rpuch",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=rpuch&avatarId=48468",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=rpuch&avatarId=48468",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=rpuch&avatarId=48468",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=rpuch&avatarId=48468"
            },
            "displayName": "Roman Puchkovskiy",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Samara"
          },
          "body": "Attaching a test (which is a Maven project).\nAccessManager denies removal of any item.\nTest contains two methods: one for removal of node (passes), another for move of node (fails).",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rpuch",
            "name": "rpuch",
            "key": "rpuch",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=rpuch&avatarId=48468",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=rpuch&avatarId=48468",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=rpuch&avatarId=48468",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=rpuch&avatarId=48468"
            },
            "displayName": "Roman Puchkovskiy",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Samara"
          },
          "created": "2008-05-19T17:50:13.712+0000",
          "updated": "2008-05-19T17:50:13.712+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12396333/comment/12649689",
          "id": "12649689",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=angela",
            "name": "angela",
            "key": "anchela",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Angela Schreiber",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "When moving a node using Session.move() the moved node doesn't get marked as removed (as it would be upon Node.remove). Since the permissions are checked based on the state modifications upon save() only, the check for REMOVE permission is omitted.\n\nHowever: The same test being execute with a Workspace.move(String, String) would fail, as the BatchedItemOperations explicitely check for both: REMOVE permission on the target node and ADD_NODE permission on the destination parent.\n\nFor consistency between Session.move() and Workspace.move() i would opt for adding the corresponding permission check to Session.move(). ",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=angela",
            "name": "angela",
            "key": "anchela",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Angela Schreiber",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2008-11-21T15:52:01.743+0000",
          "updated": "2008-11-21T15:52:01.743+0000"
        }
      ],
